Packages are Debian i386 binaries of glibc 2.43-2 and gcc-14 (libgcc_s,
libstdc++ 6.0.33) extracted with `ar p data.tar.xz | tar xJf -`. Only the
primary libc6 package is downloaded through the Compile machinery; the two
gcc-14 packages are fetched by the recipe (urls + md5s hard-coded at the top of
the Recipe).
